# Phase 4 – DependencyAnalyzerService

## Overview

The `DependencyAnalyzerService` is the orchestration layer of the Dependency Analyzer.

Its responsibility is to execute all dependency detectors, collect their results, and combine them into a single `DependencyAnalysisResult`.

The service itself should contain **no dependency detection logic**.

Each detector remains responsible for one specific concern, while the analyzer service coordinates them.

---

