# Next Step — DependencyAnalyzerTool

Once `DependencyAnalyzerService` compiles successfully, the next layer is:

```text
DependencyAnalyzerService
          │
          ▼
DependencyAnalyzerTool
          │
          ▼
DeveloperToolBase
          │
          ▼
DeveloperToolMcpAdapter
          │
          ▼
Filesystem MCP Server
          │
          ▼
MCP Gateway
          │
          ▼
AI Service
```

The tool will expose the dependency analysis to the AI using a developer-friendly MCP tool such as:

```text
analyzeDependencies
```

The AI will then be able to ask the MCP layer for structured dependency information instead of reading `package.json` manually.
